Upgrades: this build is shard-db 2026.11.2. A filesystem-empty DB_ROOT initializes directly; every non-empty root must have valid clean-open evidence at or after shard-db 2026.10.2 and before this binary's version. This release does not migrate: roots must carry shard-db 2026.09.2 clean-open evidence — older roots must first be opened once by 2026.09.2, then upgraded. Run './shard-db version' to inspect a binary without starting it. Legacy v1 objects (pre-2026.05.5) still require the historical 2026.05.4 ./migrate upgrade path before this binary can open them.
